      <slug></slug>
      <title>Étoilé: What has been done over the past year and what&#39;s next?</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>World of GNUstep devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this presentation, we will take a look at the Étoilé progresses over the past year. We will summarize our work on both our core frameworks and GNUstep to which we have contributed a lot recently. We will also discuss the project status in a broader way, and what can be expected in 2011.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
